---
// src/components/FinalCTA.astro — Chamada Final de Conversão (15 Vagas)
---

<section class="py-28 sm:py-32 px-4 sm:px-8 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-[#2e224d]">
  <!-- Dot grid fundo -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-grid-bg opacity-30 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Glow central Lime + Purple -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[900px] h-[450px] bg-[#6a5fc1]/10 rounded-full blur-[180px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10 w-full">
    <!-- Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full badge-glow mb-8" data-anim="fade-up">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#c2ef4e] micro-pulse"></span>
      <span class="text-xs font-sans font-semibold text-[#c2ef4e] tracking-wide uppercase">Apenas 15 Vagas Fundadoras · Turma Alpha</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Headline -->
    <h2 class="font-sans font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl tracking-tight leading-[1.08] mb-6 text-[#ffffff]" data-anim="fade-up">
      Pronto para parar de traduzir e<br /><span class="text-gradient-lime">falar inglês no reflexo?</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="text-[#cfcfdb] text-base sm:text-lg mb-12 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" data-anim="fade-up">
      Cada aluno na Turma Alpha tem 3 sessões individuais por semana com o professor Gabriel + prática diária com IA. Por isso são apenas 15 vagas estritas.
    </p>

    <!-- Comparação -->
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-0 sm:divide-x sm:divide-[#3b2c60] mb-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-left p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-[#271d40]/80 border border-[#3b2c60]" data-anim="fade-up">
      <!-- Modelo Tradicional -->
      <div class="sm:pr-8 pb-6 sm:pb-0">
        <p class="text-xs font-sans font-bold text-[#ffb287] uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#ffb287]"></span>
          <span>Método Tradicional</span>
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#cfcfdb]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#ffb287] shrink-0 font-bold">✕</span>
            <span>O "Lag dos 3 Segundos": traduzir na mente antes de falar</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#ffb287] shrink-0 font-bold">✕</span>
            <span>Anos pagando mensalidade sem destravar uma reunião</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#ffb287] shrink-0 font-bold">✕</span>
            <span>Caneta vermelha que gera medo e vergonha de errar</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-[#ffb287] shrink-0 font-bold">✕</span>
            <span>Aulas longas de 1h cansativas onde 80% é esquecido</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Método SPARK -->
      <div class="sm:pl-8 pt-6 sm:pt-0">
        <p class="text-xs font-sans font-bold text-[#c2ef4e] uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#c2ef4e]"></span>
          <span>Turma Alpha · SPARK</span>
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#ffffff]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#c2ef4e] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>3 sessões individuais por semana com o professor Gabriel</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#c2ef4e] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Sparring diário 24/7 no LibreChat com Spaced Recasting</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#c2ef4e] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Portal do Aluno com missões guiadas e gravações</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#c2ef4e] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>R$ 197/mês travado + Garantia incondicional de 30 dias</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto" data-anim="fade-up">
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/5511967239791?text=Ol%C3%A1%20Gabe!%20Quero%20uma%20das%2015%20vagas%20da%20Turma%20Alpha%20por%20R$%20197/m%C3%AAs"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full py-4 px-8 rounded-full bg-[#c2ef4e] text-[#1f1633] font-sans font-extrabold text-base hover:bg-[#b0dc41] active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-xl shadow-[#c2ef4e]/20 group cursor-pointer"
      >
        <span>Garantir Minha Vaga no WhatsApp</span>
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <p class="text-[#cfcfdb] text-xs mt-4 font-sans">
        Apenas 15 vagas fundadoras · Atendimento direto com Gabriel Lima · R$ 197/mês
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
